        },
        "text": "Drug abusers \r\nMore Likely to\r\ncommit Crime\r\n\r\n• Higher criminal activity during active drug  \r\n use, with a six-fold increase in the  \r\n \r\n number of crime days in Baltimore, US.\r\n\r\n 3 to 4 times greater for drug users.\r\n\r\n• Likelihood of committing homicide was   \r\n nearly 9 times greater for an individual  \r\n who had used methamphetamine within the  \r\n month prior to being arrested, in US.     \r\n\r\n• 40% increase in number of drug-related  \r\n homicides after decriminalisation of drug  \r\n use in Portugal.\r\n\r\n drug-motivated theft is much higher   \r\n for a heavy drug user.\r\n\r\n•  Illegal drug use increased the odds of  \r\n \r\n committing any crime by 6 times.\r\n\r\n",
